assets/incoming/*
!assets/incoming/README.md

# Playwright browser profiles
.playwright-profile/

# Frame-extraction scratch
**/renders/frames/
**/renders/frames-*/

# Render scratch dirs (any path)
**/render-work-*/
**/work-*/


# Prepped A-roll renditions — regenerate with scripts/prep-bf-assets.sh
